<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>浏览器扩展 on 秋 草 观 “测” 台</title><link>https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/tags/%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95/</link><description>Recent content in 浏览器扩展 on 秋 草 观 “测” 台</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-cn</language><copyright>|by 城下秋草（公众号： 秋草说测试）</copyright><lastBuildDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/tags/%E6%B5%8F%E8%A7%88%E5%99%A8%E6%89%A9%E5%B1%95/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>浏览器扩展的自动化测试：从安装、弹窗到版本迁移</title><link>https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/post/142-browser-extension-testing/</link><pubDate>Wed, 28 Oct 2026 09:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/post/142-browser-extension-testing/</guid><description>&lt;img src="https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/post/142-browser-extension-testing/cover.webp" alt="Featured image of post 浏览器扩展的自动化测试：从安装、弹窗到版本迁移" />&lt;p>测试浏览器扩展，和测试一个网页不是同一件事。除了页面渲染，你可能还要准备扩展自己的存储数据、打开它的弹窗（popup）、选项页（options）或侧边栏（side panel）、触发浏览器级事件，并且验证版本升级时旧数据能否正确迁移。官方的扩展指南给出了起点：启动浏览器时加载扩展、等待它的 service worker、拿到扩展 ID。但真正与扩展相关的测试逻辑，仍然需要一套 fixture 和辅助函数来支撑。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>本文用一个具体的扩展作为样本，覆盖三类最常见也最容易漏测的场景：安装行为、弹窗交互、版本升级的数据迁移。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="样本一个待办清单扩展">样本：一个待办清单扩展
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>样本扩展是一个简单的待办清单。用户打开弹窗后可以看到任务列表、新增条目、删除已完成的条目：&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/post/142-browser-extension-testing/02-fig1_hu_5765199b59c0be45.webp"
width="1024"
height="676"
srcset="https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/post/142-browser-extension-testing/02-fig1_hu_9a3473616f69f579.webp 480w, https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/post/142-browser-extension-testing/02-fig1_hu_5765199b59c0be45.webp 1024w"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="151"
data-flex-basis="363px"
>
&lt;/p>
&lt;p>弹窗中的待办清单示例，任务数据保存在 chrome.storage.local 中&lt;/p>
&lt;p>任务保存在 &lt;code>chrome.storage.local&lt;/code> 里，弹窗每次打开时读取已保存的列表并渲染。这个结构很典型：一个后台脚本（background / service worker）负责安装与升级时的逻辑，一个弹窗页面负责交互，存储作为二者之间的状态载体。测试要覆盖的正是这三者之间的联动。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="环境准备">环境准备
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>先安装依赖：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">npm install -D @playwright/test playwright-webext
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">npx playwright install chromium
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>然后把扩展构建到 &lt;code>dist&lt;/code> 目录，并在 Playwright 配置里指向构建产物：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-ts" data-lang="ts">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// playwright.config.ts
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kr">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">defineConfig&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">from&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;@playwright/test&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">type&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">WebextOptions&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">from&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;playwright-webext&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">export&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">default&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">defineConfig&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;lt;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nt">WebextOptions&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">&amp;gt;({&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">testDir&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;./test&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">use&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">extensionPath&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;./dist&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">},&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>这里体现出的第一个价值点：扩展路径进入配置之后，测试用例本身不再需要关心&amp;quot;怎么把扩展装进浏览器&amp;quot;。官方方案里需要自己处理的部分——以持久化上下文启动浏览器、等待 service worker 就绪、解析扩展 ID——被收敛进了 fixture。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>需要提醒的是，扩展只能在持久化上下文里加载，这是 Playwright 官方扩展方案的前提。在 CI 环境使用无头模式时，要先确认所用的无头模式支持加载扩展，否则会出现扩展未安装但断言仍&amp;quot;通过&amp;quot;的假绿。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="用例一安装行为">用例一：安装行为
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>最基础的一类场景是安装时的副作用。样本扩展在安装时会把当前日期写入 storage，用于统计：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-js" data-lang="js">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// background.js
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">chrome&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">runtime&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">onInstalled&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">addListener&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(({&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">reason&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">})&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">if&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">reason&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">===&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;install&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">chrome&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">storage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">local&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">set&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">({&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">installationDate&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">new&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nb">Date&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">().&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">toISOString&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>对应的测试只有一行断言：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">6
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-ts" data-lang="ts">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// test/install.spec.ts
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kr">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">test&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">from&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;playwright-webext&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">test&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;saves the installation date&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">async&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">({&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">})&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">storage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">local&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">expect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;installationDate&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">toMatch&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="sr">/^\d{4}-\d{2}-\d{2}/&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;code>extension&lt;/code> fixture 会在每个测试前自动安装扩展；&lt;code>storage.local.expect()&lt;/code> 则会等待安装回调把值写入，再匹配以 &lt;code>YYYY-MM-DD&lt;/code> 开头的时间戳。这个&amp;quot;等待&amp;quot;很关键——安装回调是异步触发的，直接读存储几乎必然读到空值，这也是手写扩展测试时最常见的假失败来源。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>运行：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">npx playwright &lt;span class="nb">test&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>默认以无头模式运行 Chromium，结果直接输出到终端。想看真实浏览器里的执行过程，加 &lt;code>--headed&lt;/code>：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">npx playwright &lt;span class="nb">test&lt;/span> --headed
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>如果扩展没有按预期写入安装日期，测试会明确报错并指出断言内容。相比&amp;quot;跑一遍看看有没有报错&amp;quot;，这类断言把安装时序变成了可回归的行为契约。&lt;/p>
&lt;h2 id="用例二弹窗交互">用例二：弹窗交互
&lt;/h2>&lt;p>第二类场景是弹窗。做法是先在存储里准备两条任务，打开弹窗验证它们被渲染出来，再删除第一条，最后验证存储里只剩第二条：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">15
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">16
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">17
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">18
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">19
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">20
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">21
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">22
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">23
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-ts" data-lang="ts">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// test/popup.spec.ts
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kr">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">expect&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">from&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;@playwright/test&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kr">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">test&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">from&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;playwright-webext&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">test&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;shows saved tasks in the popup&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">async&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">({&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">})&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// prepare 2 tasks in storage
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">storage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">local&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kr">set&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">({&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">todos&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Buy groceries&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Read a book&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">],&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// open the popup and check the tasks are visible
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">const&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">popup&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">openPopup&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">();&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">expect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">popup&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">getByRole&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;listitem&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">toContainText&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Buy groceries&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Read a book&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">]);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// delete the task
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">popup&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">getByRole&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;button&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">name&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Delete Buy groceries&amp;#39;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">click&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">();&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// check the storage for remaining task
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">storage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">local&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">expect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;todos&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">toEqual&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Read a book&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">]);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>&lt;code>extension.openPopup()&lt;/code> 返回一个普通的 Playwright &lt;code>Page&lt;/code> 实例，因此弹窗内部可以继续使用熟悉的定位器与断言。&lt;code>toContainText&lt;/code> 会自动等待任务出现在弹窗里，并且允许列表里有额外条目，但要求这两条按给定顺序出现。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>这个用例同时建立了一条跨接口的验证链：写入存储 → 渲染 UI → 交互 → 回写存储。只断言 UI 会漏掉&amp;quot;数据没保存&amp;quot;的缺陷，只断言存储会漏掉&amp;quot;渲染坏了&amp;quot;的缺陷，两者一起才完整。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>跑完之后可以打开 HTML 报告，用 trace viewer 逐步骤回看，并查看每一步的页面截图：&lt;/p>
&lt;p>&lt;img src="https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/post/142-browser-extension-testing/02-fig2_hu_5e8efc642e6b6411.webp"
width="1024"
height="677"
srcset="https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/post/142-browser-extension-testing/02-fig2_hu_ad46e3f2cd0b6d92.webp 480w, https://chengxiaqiucao.github.io/post/142-browser-extension-testing/02-fig2_hu_5e8efc642e6b6411.webp 1024w"
loading="lazy"
class="gallery-image"
data-flex-grow="151"
data-flex-basis="363px"
