&lt;/div>&lt;p>v2 里改为对象数组：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt">1
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-json" data-lang="json">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;todos&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;Buy groceries&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;done&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">},&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;name&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s2">&amp;#34;Read a book&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nt">&amp;#34;done&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kc">false&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}]&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>迁移逻辑写在升级回调里，测试可以这样写：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;div class="chroma">
&lt;table class="lntable">&lt;tr>&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code>&lt;span class="lnt"> 1
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 2
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 3
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 4
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 5
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 6
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 7
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 8
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt"> 9
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">10
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">11
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">12
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">13
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">14
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">15
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">16
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">17
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">18
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">19
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">20
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">21
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">22
&lt;/span>&lt;span class="lnt">23
&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>
&lt;td class="lntd">
&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-ts" data-lang="ts">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">// test/migration.spec.ts
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kr">import&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">test&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">from&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;playwright-webext&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">test&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">use&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">({&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extensionAutoInstall&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="kt">false&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nx">test&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;migrates todos from v1 to v2&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kr">async&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">({&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">})&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&amp;gt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// install the old version
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">install&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;./test/dist-v1&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// populate the storage
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">storage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">local&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kr">set&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">({&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nx">todos&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">[&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Buy groceries&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Read a book&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">],&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// upgrade to the new version
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">upgrade&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">();&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="c1">// check the migrated data
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="c1">&lt;/span> &lt;span class="k">await&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">extension&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">storage&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">local&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">.&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">expect&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;todos&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">).&lt;/span>&lt;span class="nx">toEqual&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">([&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">name&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Buy groceries&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">done&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="kt">false&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">},&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">name&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">:&lt;/span> &lt;span class="s1">&amp;#39;Read a book&amp;#39;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nx">done&lt;/span>: &lt;span class="kt">false&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">},&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">]);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">});&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/td>&lt;/tr>&lt;/table>
&lt;/div>
&lt;/div>&lt;p>两个关键点：把 v1 的构建产物放在单独目录（如 &lt;code>test/dist-v1&lt;/code>），v2 仍放在配置里的 &lt;code>dist&lt;/code>；用 &lt;code>test.use({ extensionAutoInstall: false })&lt;/code> 关掉自动安装，让测试先手动安装旧版本。&lt;code>extension.upgrade()&lt;/code> 会保留扩展已存储的数据并触发升级回调，v2 在回调里把字符串转成对象，存储断言等待结果出现。&lt;/p>
&lt;p>这条用例保证的是&amp;quot;老用户升级后任务还在&amp;quot;。这类缺陷一旦漏到线上，影响的是全部存量用户，而且通常不可回滚——数据已经被新版本改写了。&lt;/p>
